    1: """Long-lived local ProcessForge Runtime process.
    2: 
    3: This module owns process lifecycle and loopback IPC only. It delegates project
    4: routing, event ingestion, Ledger, Director, Inspector, and projections to
    5: existing PF Core/Runtime Host helpers.
    6: """
