 5721: During ordinary project work, do not install, start, restart, or repair PF
 5722: Runtime, MCP, host hooks, or Agent Ledger. Use available PF tools. If a Forge or
 5723: host integration is unavailable and PF returns an operator-level blocker,
 5724: report it concisely to the operator. Garage context, search, resolve, and work
 5725: bootstrap do not require a Runtime daemon, hooks, or a manual Ledger session.
 5726: 
 5727: Do not expose local absolute paths from `.pf/process-forge.local.yaml`. Do not
 5728: call a distribution-local CLI path from this project root unless this project
 5729: is the ProcessForge distribution itself.
